  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our vision of change: community museums and schools strengthening visions from the past and the future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unin de Museos Comunitarios de Oaxaca, A.C. (UMCO) will expand its workshops to include additional middle and high school students interested in expressing themselves creatively through radio, video, murals and other media. UMCO will invite education policy makers to talks and a symposium where they will discuss UMCO&apos;s approach for developing leadership, technical skills and cultural identity among marginalized children and adolescents in rural municipalities of Oaxaca. UMCO will also develop a training manual for middle and high school teachers. Activities will involve an additional 530 teachers and adolescents.</narrative>
  </description>
